.Dd September 21, 2026
.Dt UGOLD 4
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm ugold
.Nd TEMPer gold HID thermometer
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Cd device usb
.Cd device hid
.Cd device ugold
.Pp
In
.Xr loader.conf 5 :
.Cd ugold_load="YES"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
driver provides support for pcsensors TEMPer gold devices.
.Pp
The driver possesses a collection of sensor values which are
made available through the
.Xr sysctl 8
interface.
.Sh HARDWARE
The
.Nm
driver supports the following HID thermometers:
.Pp
.Bl -bullet -compact
.It
RDing TEMPer1V1.2
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr usb 4 ,
.Xr sysctl 8
